https://github.com/doxygen/doxygen/commit/26e908779f448574c6b8918aff21a40565a89a57

Doxygen 1.18.0 can access yytext[npos-1] while parsing ordinary commands
without brace options. Preserve the upstream guards and tab-marker fix.

